{"4443350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombuds", "steam_appid": 4443350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4936290, 4845600], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fifteen years after the outbreak, society is slowly crawling back to the Age of Abundance inside safe settlements. Outside the walls, zombies still haunt the loot-packed ruins, and desperate survivors risk their necks for a payday.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>But you're not here to survive the new world. You're here to own it.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to provide  what people <i>really</i> want in order to survive with a smile on their faces. <i>No matter what it is.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, manufacture and distribute a variety of questionable goods across a <strong>zombie-infested sandbox</strong> to become the baddest <strong>apocalypse tycoon</strong> in this <i>open-world co-op sim</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/6389c5c24c96f23fa13d65c6afe6237f.poster.avif?t=1785777855\" width=780 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/6389c5c24c96f23fa13d65c6afe6237f.webm?t=1785777855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/6389c5c24c96f23fa13d65c6afe6237f.mp4?t=1785777855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sprawling <strong>sandbox</strong> full of <strong>zombies</strong>, <strong>survivors</strong> and <strong>secrets</strong> in first or third person.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong>, <strong>clear</strong> and <strong>claim</strong> a number of locations to turn them into <strong>profitable operations</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/8da0524adb4fb0a32b6e8487549a34ae.poster.avif?t=1785777855\" width=780 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/8da0524adb4fb0a32b6e8487549a34ae.webm?t=1785777855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/8da0524adb4fb0a32b6e8487549a34ae.mp4?t=1785777855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce <strong>drugs</strong>, <strong>meds</strong> and <strong>bizarre apocalyptic substances</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every setup is yours to plan</strong>, so shape your rise in your own style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/124555645c7b08a895f19590658b2287.poster.avif?t=1785777855\" width=780 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/124555645c7b08a895f19590658b2287.webm?t=1785777855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443350/extras/124555645c7b08a895f19590658b2287.mp4?t=1785777855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire <strong>desperate survivors</strong> to do your dirty work, or <strong>brainwash zombies</strong> into 